    "intro": "Halal Syrian-Lebanese cooking, a one-minute walk from Mangos Cafe. Here's what people say after eating with us.",
    "googleReviewUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mangos+Mediterranean+Grill+17+Smith+Pl+Columbus+OH+43201",
    "averageRating": 4.7,
    "totalCount": 186,
    "items": [
      { "id": "gr-1", "author": "Omar H.", "rating": 5, "text": "Finally a proper halal spot in Short North. The chicken shawarma tastes like home — you can tell the marinade sits overnight. Chef Adnan came out to check on our table himself.", "source": "Google", "date": "1 month ago", "mock": true },
      { "id": "gr-2", "author": "Rachel B.", "rating": 5, "text": "The build-your-own bowl is such a good deal. Got saffron rice, chicken kebab and every topping they'd let me pile on. Portion was huge and it came out in maybe six minutes.", "source": "Google", "date": "3 weeks ago", "mock": true },
      { "id": "gr-3", "author": "Yousef A.", "rating": 5, "text": "Lamb chops were charred exactly right, still pink inside. The garlic toum is the real thing, not the watered-down version. Been three times this month.", "source": "Google", "date": "2 months ago", "mock": true },
      { "id": "gr-4", "author": "Megan C.", "rating": 4, "text": "Great falafel and the mezze sampler is perfect for two. Only note is it gets packed at lunch, so order ahead if you're on a break.", "source": "Google", "date": "5 weeks ago", "mock": true },
      { "id": "gr-5", "author": "Tunde O.", "rating": 5, "text": "Came for the halal certification, stayed because the food is genuinely excellent. Fattoush is bright and fresh, and the pita comes out warm every time.", "source": "Google", "date": "2 weeks ago", "mock": true }
    ]
  },
